{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>由 Yash Future Tech Solutions Pvt Ltd 開發的 Super Kids Racing Mini Edition，現於 Epic Games 平台在 PC（Windows）<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，截止時間為 11 月 8 日 18:30（香港時間）。遊戲主打四季主題賽車、多種車款與親友同玩體驗。</p>\n<p>玩家要在叢林、雪地、熔岩、過山車及城市五種環境中完成挑戰，每個季節設 10 個關卡，合共 50 關，每關最少跑 3 圈。遊戲提供 50 款車輛選擇；單人用方向鍵遊玩，P 鍵暫停，多人時第二位玩家用 WASD 操作，並支援鍵盤及控制器。</p>\n<p>本作支援分割畫面多人模式，可與朋友及家人同場競速；官方標明適合全年齡玩家，並提供多語言支援。整體以容易上手的休閒賽車為定位，結合多季節場景、豐富車款與本地多人玩法。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"【PC】分割畫面多人模式賽車 Super Kids Racing Mini Edition 限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Ss-A0edbb042a88a5b1415a46b6db150c576e6afb94-1920x1080-1.jpg\" width=\"1920\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"【PC】分割畫面多人模式賽車 Super Kids Racing Mini Edition 限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Ss-49300f1d5b2b0dc2745b5f1a4e4abd2cd10457e2-1920x1080-1.jpg\" width=\"1920\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"【PC】分割畫面多人模式賽車 Super Kids Racing Mini Edition 限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Ss-5163abd893bece5d4f5c0ae00355341b4d137b70-1920x1080-1.jpg\" width=\"1920\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"【PC】分割畫面多人模式賽車 Super Kids Racing Mini Edition 限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Ss-D5934db97464c993a827d2721c366503edfeb333-1920x1080-1.jpg\" width=\"1920\"/></figure>\n<p>遊戲名稱：Super Kids Racing Mini Edition<br/>支援平台：Windows<br/>領取位置：<a href=\"https://store.epicgames.com/p/super-kids-racing-mini-edition-65c0fa\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Epic Games</a></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T13:22:00.856068+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":425,"images":4,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T13:09:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T17:10:25.547848+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T13:19:04.763317+00:00","content_hash":"979eec257e899a16b81469cfb37d52e3e207395f231bc80f7406f5fc8e9a9f92","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}